\title{Relationship of an implication to its variants}
\date{2026-01-28T21:09:27Z}
\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Theorem}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{An implication and its contrapositive always have the same
  truth value.  On the other hand, an implication does \em{not}
  always have the same truth value as its inverse or converse.}
